TI  - Clinical examination for identifying low-risk pregnancies suitable for expectant management beyond 40–41 gestational weeks: maternal and fetal outcomes
AU  - Gulim Murzakanova
AU  - Sari Räisänen
AU  - Anne Flem Jacobsen
AU  - Branka M. Yli
AU  - Tiril Tingleff
AU  - Katariina Laine
