TI  - Intrapartum interventions and outcomes for women and children following induction of labour at term in uncomplicated pregnancies: a 16-year population-based linked data study
AU  - Hannah Dahlen
AU  - Charlene Thornton
AU  - Soo Downe
AU  - Ank de Jonge
AU  - Anna E. Seijmonsbergen‐Schermers
AU  - Sally Tracy
AU  - Mark Tracy
AU  - Andrew Bisits
AU  - Lilian L. Peters
