TI  - Comparison of cesarean section rates between obstetricians preferring labor induction at early versus late gestational age
AU  - Liu-Ching Wu
AU  - Fu‐Shaing Peng
AU  - Cheung Leung
AU  - Hsin-Fen Lu
AU  - Ho‐Hsiung Lin
