TI  - Intrapartum exposure to synthetic oxytocin, maternal BMI, and neurodevelopmental outcomes in children within the ECHO consortium
AU  - Lisa Kurth
AU  - T. Michael O’Shea
AU  - Irina Burd
AU  - Anne L. Dunlop
AU  - Lisa Croen
AU  - Greta Wilkening
AU  - Ting-ju Hsu
